        @* Definition is OPTIONAL in xAPI, and every other optional section in this view guards its
           own root the same way (Authority, Context, Result). This one dereferenced Definition
           directly and threw a NullReferenceException for any statement whose object has none,
           which 500d the whole modal -- and the void button lives in it. Reachable since the T3
           ingest fix correctly stopped writing a blank Definition row per activity. *@
